    "detail": {
      "id": 1350023,
      "name": "[Ellen] Mist Tide Resurgence",
      "desc": "When launching an <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color>, or <color=#FFFFFF>Ultimate</color>, Ellen <color=#2BAD00>leaves behind a patch of Icy Mist</color> on the ground, dealing <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG over time</color> for 15s. Friendly Agents have <color=#2BAD00>increased Anti-Interrupt Level</color> and <color=#2BAD00>their DMG received reduced by 30%</color> in the <color=#FFFFFF>Icy Mist</color>. Upon leaving the <color=#FFFFFF>Icy Mist</color>, the effect continues for 5s. When Ellen attacks an enemy within the <color=#FFFFFF>Icy Mist</color>, an extra instance of <color=#FFFFFF>Icy Mist</color> DMG will be triggered.",
